{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12408","headline":"猷川雪後送僧粲临还京时避世卧疾 · 钱起","name":"猷川雪後送僧粲临还京时避世卧疾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"连步青溪几万重，有时共立在孤峯。\n斋到盂空餐雪麦，经传金字坐云松。\n呻吟独卧猷川水，振锡先闻长乐钟。\n回望羣山携手处，离心一一涕无从。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12408.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12408","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}